title: d0_predinner
---
<<tor TransitionCanvas HomeLower>>
<<cameratarget Cameras Table>>
Eddy: Dinner's ready, everyone!!!
<<cross TransitionCanvas 1.5>>
<<clockscale UICanvas 0>>
<<wait 0.5>>
<<settime TimeManager 0 dinner>>
===
title: d0_dinner
---
<<yarnsprite YarnController player false>>
<<yarnoff YarnController table>>
Eddy: Fuwaaa....&shock
Eddy: I am. Officially. FULL!&shock
Mom: Good, right? You even drank all the soup this time.@v
Dad: Gyahaha, look at him pat his belly! Just like me.&happy
Eddy: Real good.@&happy
Dad: That's your mom's cooking, all right.@v
Mom: Of course.&smirk
Ellen: Okay but, is it just me, or is this seriously SPICY!?@&shock
->Just you
    Eddy: Just you. Undisciplined tastebuds.&smirk
->Me too
    Eddy: I drank 3 cups of water and my nose is running.
    Eddy: But it's just you.&smirk
Ellen: My tongue's burning....
Ellen: Are there extra peppers or something?
Mom: Quynh.:Ellen's Vietnamese name.@v&annoyed
Mom: No English at the table.
Ellen: Oh, okay --@&skeptical
Ellen: Seriously so spicy I could DIE.@v&shock
Mom: Mhmm hmm. It's a new recipe Bác Giang sent me.&blank
Eddy: She texted you a whole recipe?@
Mom: From Youtube.
Eddy: Whoa.
Ellen: Wowww. You're so advanced now!
Eddy: I saw dad use "lol" the other day and thought, "he's too old to be using that".
Eddy: Then I had to re-assess my own age.&shock
Dad: Even old people have to learn someday, Eddy.@v
Eddy: Yeah. If only Ellen could figure that out....@&psh
Ellen: ...Hey!
Mom: We have to learn.@v
Mom: Or DIE.&shock
Eddy: It's not THAT serious!&shock
Dad: That's why I follow the news.
Mom: And why I read books.@v
Dad: And what your homework's for.
Mom: Do your homework.&tired
Mom: Or DIE.&shock
Eddy: Uhhh....@&uh
Ellen: Well, <i>I</i> at least got halfway through my discussion posts.&smirk
Ellen: Four of them. Then I have to get ready for clinicals.&skeptical
Ellen: Man, med school sucks.&tired
Eddy: And <i>I</i>...!
Eddy: Am going to get to that tomorrow.&shock
Eddy: Hehe.
Mom: How much homework?@v&annoyed
<<if $vdesk is true>>
    Eddy: I'm not sure off the top of my head, but...@&uh
    Eddy: I wrote everything down for later!&uh
    Mom: Hmm.@v
<<else>>
    Eddy: I... can check after dinner.@&uh
    Eddy: I... forgot.&uh
    Mom: You don't even know what homework you have!?@v&annoyed
<<endif>>
Eddy: I mean, I just got them today. I'll handle it by Sunday.@
Mom: That's what you always say.@v
Dad: It's always better to do it early. Why take breaks when you can just do it now?
->Argue
    <<set $d0_argue to true>>
    Eddy: Well, I don't forget on purpose or something.&ashamed
    Mom: If it really mattered to you, you'd remember.@v&tired
    Ellen: True.
    Eddy: Ellen -- ugh. You're not helping!@
    Eddy: I just don't need you to... get mad at me for it, when I'm already mad at myself.&ashamed
    Mom: If you didn't "need" me, then you would've already done it.@v
->Do not
    <<set $d0_argue to false>>
Eddy: Okay, okay....@&away
Mom: Don't "okay, okay." Just do it.@v
Eddy: ....@&ashamed
Ellen: ANYWAY.@away
Ellen: Need to get back to work!
Ellen: Eddy -- Discussion posts.
Ellen: Help me edit?&evil
Eddy: ...What's in it for me?@skeptical
Ellen: Your sister's mental health and academic achievement?
Eddy: *yawn*&psh
Eddy: I'll start bidding at one bingsu.@smirk
Eddy: Nah I'm just kidding, I'll help.
Ellen: Well, I have an extra bubble tea in the fridge. You can have it.
Mom: When did you get bubble tea?@v
Ellen: Uh....@
Ellen: I went out with some friends earlier. Right after class.
Ellen: Speaking of -- gotta finish this assignment by midnight. See ya!
Dad: Then I'll cut some fruit.
Dad: You start cleaning up, Eddy.
Eddy: Okay....&uh
Ellen: Bye!
<<cross TransitionCanvas 2>>
<<hide YarnController EllenSit>>
<<wait 2>>
<<cameratarget Cameras Player>>
<<yarnsprite YarnController player true>>
<<settod TimeManager night>>
<<yarnon YarnController table>>
Eddy: Ellen's acting weird.... Maybe I should talk to her about it.&uh
===
title: d0_help
---
<<set $bowlstaken to 0>>
<<set $bowlmom to false>>
<<set $bowleddy to false>>
<<set $bowlellen to false>>
<<set $bowldad to false>>
<<set $disable_stairs to true>>
Eddy: Ooh, that smells good!&shock
Eddy: *sniff sniff*
Eddy: Mmmmm.&happy
<<cameratarget Cameras Table>>
Eddy: That's definitely bun bo hue.:A spicy Vietnamese noodle soup made with rice noodles, beef, lemongrass, and often pig's blood, oxtail, and beansprouts.
<<camerashake Cameras .5 .1 100>>
Dad: Eddy! Bring these bowls out!
<<cameratarget Cameras Player>>
Eddy: Okay!
===
title: bowl
---
<<set $hasbowl to true>>
<<set $bowlstaken to $bowlstaken + 1>>
<<yarnoff YarnController bowl>>

<< if $bowlstaken == 1 >>
    Let's go set this on the table, like Dad asked.
<<elseif $bowlstaken == 2>>
    Two out of four....
<<elseif $bowlstaken == 3>>
    Three out of four....
<<elseif $bowlstaken == 4>>
    This is the last one.
    After this, we can eat!
<<endif>>
===
title: d0_ellenchair
---
Ellen sits here.
Always taking so long to get downstairs... tsk, tsk.
<<if $bowlstaken < 4 && $bowlstaken > 0>>
    <<if $bowlellen is false >>
        <<if $hasbowl is true>>
            Okay, there's Ellen's bowl.
            <<set $bowlellen to true>>
            <<set $hasbowl to false>>
            <<wait 0.1>>
            <<yarnon YarnController bowl1>>
            [[morebowls]]
        <<endif>>
    <<else>>
        She already has a bowl.
        ...Ellen's probably gonna get ice cream after this anyway.
    <<endif>>
<<elseif $bowlstaken == 4>>
    This is way too much food for Ellen.
    :This is like, pho xe lua-sized.:Literally "pho train," meaning a very large ("the size of a train") portion of pho.
<<endif>>
===
title: d0_eddychair
---
I usually sit here.
<<if $bowlstaken < 4 && $bowlstaken > 0>>
    <<if $bowleddy is false >>
        <<if $hasbowl is true>>
            Okay, there's my bowl.
            <<set $bowleddy to true>>
            <<set $hasbowl to false>>
            <<wait 0.1>>
            <<yarnon YarnController bowl2>>
            [[morebowls]]
        <<endif>>
    <<else>>
        I already have a bowl.
        Dad always gets me too much regardless, since I need to beef up from twig form.
    <<endif>>
<<elseif $bowlstaken == 4>>
    I definitely can't eat a bowl this big.
    :This is like, pho xe lua-sized.:Literally "pho train," meaning a very large ("the size of a train") portion of pho.
<<endif>>
===
title: d0_dadchair
---
<<if $bowlstaken < 4>>
    Dad sits here.
    He eats more than us and usually gets his portion last, so let's get everyone else's first.
<<elseif $bowlstaken == 4 && $hasbowl is true >>
    <<set $hasbowl to false>>
    Last but not least, dad's bowl!
    With that, we can finally eat.
    <<wait 0.1>>
    <<yarnon YarnController bowl3>>
    [[d0_predinner]]
<<endif>>
===
title: d0_momchair
---
Mom usually sits here.
<<if ($bowlstaken < 4) && ($bowlstaken > 0)>>
    <<if $bowlmom is false >>
        <<if $hasbowl is true >>
            Okay, there's mom's bowl.
            <<set $bowlmom to true>>
            <<set $hasbowl to false >>
            <<wait 0.1>>
            <<yarnon YarnController bowl4>>
            [[morebowls]]
        <<endif>>
    <<else>>
        Mom already has a bowl! She doesn't eat much, anyway.
    <<endif>>
<<elseif $bowlstaken == 4>>
    Mom definitely can't eat a bowl this big.
    :This is like, pho xe lua-sized.:Literally "pho train," meaning a very large ("the size of a train") portion of pho.
<<endif>>
===
title: morebowls
---
Dad: Eddy! Here's the next one.
<<wait 0.1>>
<<yarnon YarnController bowl>>
===